    "## 6. Calculate Metrics on Test Set\n",
    "\n",
    "Computes mIoU, IoU per class, Dice Score, mAP@50, mAP@50:95, and CPU latency (ms)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
